# Luo Yi, Yin-yang Geomancer

> Luo Yi is a zone-control mage who wins by turning one caught target into two lost health bars. She is strongest when the draft gives her a front line to cast through and enemies who have to walk into choke points. She becomes a liability the moment the fight is all dashes and backline access.

