## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Mid CDR Burn Control (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Blood Wings, Wishing Lantern, Divine Glaive
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Blood Wings
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Tenacity, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Flex: Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy mid and roamer cannot chain crowd control onto Luo Yi before she repositions.; Holy Crystal over Wishing Lantern when Use when the enemy front line is thin and raw magic power matters more than current-HP damage.; Winter Crown over Divine Glaive when Use against assassins that can force Flicker before the second Yin-Yang Reaction lands.
- Total cost: 11140 gold

Default ranked mid build that gives Luo Yi mana, cooldown, anti-sustain burn, and enough shielding to keep cycling Yin-Yang reactions.

### Penetration Burst (Mid)

- Items: Arcane Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal, Divine Glaive, Blood Wings
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Genius Wand, Holy Crystal
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Rupture, Bargain Hunter, Lethal Ignition
- Battle spell: Flameshot
- Flex: Glowing Wand over Genius Wand when Use when Estes, Floryn, Ruby, Uranus, or shield-heavy lineups make anti-heal mandatory.; Wishing Lantern over Holy Crystal when Use when the enemy has two durable frontliners and Luo Yi must punish grouped objective fights.; Winter Crown over Blood Wings when Use when assassins can cross the front line and force Luo Yi to survive before dealing full follow-up damage.
- Total cost: 11830 gold

Damage-first build for games where Luo Yi can play behind a stable front line and convert grouped targets into quick reaction bursts.

### Anti-Dive Safety (Mid)

- Items: Tough Boots, Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown, Divine Glaive, Immortality
- Core: Enchanted Talisman, Glowing Wand, Winter Crown
- Emblem: Mage Emblem with Inspire, Tenacity, Brave Smite
- Battle spell: Purify
- Flex: Blood Wings over Immortality when Use when the enemy dive cannot reliably finish Luo Yi through Winter Crown and shields.; Arcane Boots over Tough Boots when Use when the enemy threat is burst damage without enough crowd control to justify Fortitude.
- Total cost: 10820 gold

Defensive mid build for pick comps and assassin drafts where staying alive for one more mark cycle is worth more than peak damage.

